{"duration": 64.137, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A Royal Navy sailor painted a gun turret black to cut blinding glare.", "start": 0.08, "end": 4.045}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Britain and France declare war on Russia in March 1854.", "start": 4.465, "end": 8.207}, {"beat": 1, "text": "The Royal Navy sends ships into the Black Sea.", "start": 8.427, "end": 10.671}, {"beat": 1, "text": "The sailor's gun crew faces Sevastopol's formidable batteries.", "start": 10.891, "end": 14.527}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The Crimean campaign opens in September 1854.", "start": 14.947, "end": 18.411}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Ships sail in seven columns, each steamer towing two sailing ships.", "start": 18.631, "end": 22.433}, {"beat": 2, "text": "British and French officers sail close in a paddle-wheel ship to check those batteries.", "start": 22.653, "end": 27.158}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The sailor's fleet now uses steam ships, metal hulls, and explosive guns.", "start": 27.378, "end": 31.458}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it is like headlights sweeping your face at night.", "start": 31.878, "end": 34.378}, {"beat": 3, "text": "That glare blinds you before you can see anything.", "start": 34.598, "end": 36.817}, {"beat": 3, "text": "The Royal Navy wanted that glare gone from the sailor's turret.", "start": 37.037, "end": 40.194}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The real reason: black paint absorbs light instead of reflecting it.", "start": 40.614, "end": 44.32}, {"beat": 4, "text": "A pale turret would bounce light straight back at the gun crew.", "start": 44.54, "end": 47.378}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Black turrets cut the glare around the gun crew.", "start": 47.598, "end": 49.741}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The irony came in 1856.", "start": 50.161, "end": 52.108}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The Treaty of Paris forbade Russia from basing warships in the Black Sea.", "start": 52.328, "end": 56.05}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Russia could no longer block other warships from passing through.", "start": 56.27, "end": 59.108}, {"beat": 5, "text": "A sailor changed a turret. The treaty rewrote the rules of that sea.", "start": 59.328, "end": 63.017}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.195, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Royal", "start": 0.27, "end": 0.57, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Navy", "start": 0.62, "end": 0.895, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "sailor", "start": 0.97, "end": 1.47, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "painted", "start": 1.545, "end": 1.82, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.845, "end": 1.895, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "gun", "start": 1.97, "end": 2.17, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "turret", "start": 2.22, "end": 2.495, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "black", "start": 2.545, "end": 2.945, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "to", "start": 3.02, "end": 3.07, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "cut", "start": 3.12, "end": 3.295, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "blinding", "start": 3.345, "end": 3.695, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "glare.", "start": 3.745, "end": 4.091, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Britain", "start": 4.509, "end": 4.784, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "and", "start": 4.834, "end": 4.909, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "France", "start": 4.984, "end": 5.459, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "declare", "start": 5.509, "end": 5.834, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "war", "start": 5.909, "end": 6.109, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "on", "start": 6.134, "end": 6.259, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "Russia", "start": 6.309, "end": 6.784, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "in", "start": 6.859, "end": 6.934, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "March", "start": 6.984, "end": 7.259, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "1854.", "start": 7.309, "end": 8.283, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "The", "start": 8.492, "end": 8.542, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "Royal", "start": 8.592, "end": 8.867, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "Navy", "start": 8.892, "end": 9.242, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "sends", "start": 9.317, "end": 9.517, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "ships", "start"